      "value": "@{5f2cc2f6c00297464bd2e59c|full_name}: I knew a dev who worked on the game APB/APB: Reloaded.\n\nThe chinese stole assets from the game like crazy so eventually they started encrypting all the assets, last i talked to him about it had been 3 years since and the decryption hasnt been bypassed, and he said it'd easily take 5 years for someone to undo that",
